Red stars indicate pre- and postsynaptic autoantigens of SMS. Abbreviations: GAD, glutamic acid decarboxylase; GABAT, GABA
transporter; GABA-R, GABA receptor; GLYT, glycine transporter;
GlyR, glycine receptor; VGAT, vesicular GABA/glycine carrier.

